{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the flow as you hunt, butcher, and cook at a blisteringly fast pace in this action shop-keeping game. Hunt adorable monsters, chop colossal carcasses, and power-slice through huge chunks of flesh to serve your customers even faster. Move fast and stay sharp if you want your shop to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Butcher</strong> - chop the meat out of giant carcasses, and sell it for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/8ee7070ecdc6d9a1aeb2b455599b45e7.avif?t=1760826924\" width=800 height=375 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook</strong> - make the food exactly right for each customer, or process and sell appealing foods for the masses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/49f554436ab47d0e6ad5444d43d46488.avif?t=1760826924\" width=800 height=375 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> - slice, dice, and CHOP your enemies into delicious cuts of prime meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/47c5afe433b24d9d6b9efc0dc24e38d8.avif?t=1760826924\" width=800 height=375 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell</strong> - rows of customers keep on coming - stay sharp, get them what they want, and your shop might survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/6f45b915cebe8b8ae395c42a7e39690e.avif?t=1760826924\" width=800 height=375 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2698900?t=1760826924","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2698900?t=1760826924","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/4dd8bdd4fd39a21d4b048a53abbec0ddbfd774da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760826924","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/4dd8bdd4fd39a21d4b048a53abbec0ddbfd774da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760826924","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the flow as you hunt, butcher, and cook at a blisteringly fast pace in this action shop-keeping game. Hunt adorable monsters, chop colossal carcasses, and power-slice through huge chunks of flesh to serve your customers even faster. Move fast and stay sharp if you want your shop to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Butcher</strong> - chop the meat out of giant carcasses, and sell it for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/8ee7070ecdc6d9a1aeb2b455599b45e7.avif?t=1760826924\" width=800 height=375 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook</strong> - make the food exactly right for each customer, or process and sell appealing foods for the masses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/49f554436a